SUMMARY:The Moon occults Venus
DESCRIPTION:Venus disappears at 17:27:55 and reappears at 18:15:02 IST\, se
 en from Akola.\nThe Moon is 34° up in the SW · daylight\, Sun +13°.\nTi
 mes against the real lunar limb.\nMap\, timings and the view at the Moon's
  edge: https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?city=Akola
URL:https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?city=Akola
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
